-----------------------------------------------------------------
- Limit
-   ->  Index Scan Backward using boolindex_b_i_key on boolindex
-         Index Cond: (b = true)
-(3 rows)
-
-explain (costs off)
-  select * from boolindex where not b order by i limit 10;
-                      QUERY PLAN                       
--------------------------------------------------------
- Limit
-   ->  Index Scan using boolindex_b_i_key on boolindex
-         Index Cond: (b = false)
-(3 rows)
-
