---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Bitmap Heap Scan on onek2
-   Recheck Cond: (((unique2 = 11) AND (stringu1 < 'B'::name)) OR (unique1 = 0))
-   ->  BitmapOr
-         ->  Bitmap Index Scan on onek2_u2_prtl
-               Index Cond: (unique2 = 11)
-         ->  Bitmap Index Scan on onek2_u1_prtl
