--- UPDATE ... RETURNING returns only the updated values
--- (not the inserted side values, which are added by a separate "statement"):
-UPDATE for_portion_of_test
-  FOR PORTION OF valid_at FROM '2018-02-01' TO '2018-02-15'
-  SET name = 'three^3'
-  WHERE id = '[3,4)'
-  RETURNING *;
-  id   |        valid_at         |  name   
