-DELETE FROM for_portion_of_test
-  FOR PORTION OF valid_at FROM '2018-02-02' TO '2018-02-03'
-  WHERE id = '[3,4)'
-  RETURNING *;
-  id   |        valid_at         |  name   
--------+-------------------------+---------
- [3,4) | [2018-02-01,2018-02-10) | three^3
-(1 row)
