-----------------------------------------------
- Nested Loop Left Join
-   Output: (1), (2), (3)
-   Join Filter: (((3) = (1)) AND ((3) = (2)))
-   ->  Nested Loop
-         Output: (1), (2)
-         ->  Result
-               Output: 1
-         ->  Result
-               Output: 2
-   ->  Result
-         Output: 3
-(11 rows)
