------------------------------------------------------
- Nested Loop
-   CTE q
-     ->  Seq Scan on z2
-   ->  CTE Scan on q
-   ->  Materialize
-         ->  Seq Scan on z1
-               Filter: (((a % 2) = 0) AND f_leak(b))
