-               QUERY PLAN               
-----------------------------------------
- Merge on target t
-   ->  Merge Join
-         Merge Cond: (t.tid = s.sid)
-         ->  Sort
-               Sort Key: t.tid
-               ->  Seq Scan on target t
-         ->  Sort
-               Sort Key: s.sid
-               ->  Seq Scan on source s
