------------------------------------------
- Limit
-   ->  Incremental Sort
-         Sort Key: tenk1.four, tenk1.ten
-         Presorted Key: tenk1.four
-         ->  Sort
-               Sort Key: tenk1.four
-               ->  Seq Scan on tenk1
-(7 rows)
