--- illegal csv separators
-\pset csv_fieldsep ''
-\pset: csv_fieldsep must be a single one-byte character
-\pset csv_fieldsep '\0'
-\pset: csv_fieldsep must be a single one-byte character
-\pset csv_fieldsep '\n'
