- at_partitioned_0_id_name_key | t        | own     | child 0 index
- at_partitioned_1             | t        | own     | 
- at_partitioned_1_id_name_key | t        | own     | child 1 index
- at_partitioned_id_name_key   | t        | none    | parent index
