-               ->  Hash
-                     ->  Seq Scan on prt1_p2 t3_2
-         ->  Hash Left Join
-               Hash Cond: (t2_3.a = t3_3.a)
-               ->  Hash Left Join
-                     Hash Cond: (t1_3.a = t2_3.a)
-                     ->  Seq Scan on prt1_p3 t1_3
-                     ->  Hash
-                           ->  Seq Scan on prt1_p3 t2_3
-               ->  Hash
-                     ->  Seq Scan on prt1_p3 t3_3
