-               ->  Hash
-                     ->  Seq Scan on plt2_adv_p2 t2_2
-         ->  Hash Full Join
-               Hash Cond: ((t1_3.a = t2_3.a) AND (t1_3.c = t2_3.c))
-               Filter: ((COALESCE(t1_3.b, 0) < 10) AND (COALESCE(t2_3.b, 0) < 10))
