--------------------------------------------------
- Append
-   ->  Seq Scan on iboolpart_t iboolpart_1
-         Filter: (a = ANY ('{t,f}'::boolean[]))
-   ->  Seq Scan on iboolpart_f iboolpart_2
-         Filter: (a = ANY ('{t,f}'::boolean[]))
-   ->  Seq Scan on iboolpart_default iboolpart_3
-         Filter: (a = ANY ('{t,f}'::boolean[]))
-(7 rows)
