-         Filter: (substr(a, 1) = 'a'::text COLLATE "POSIX")
-   ->  Seq Scan on coll_pruning_multi2 coll_pruning_multi_2
-         Filter: (substr(a, 1) = 'a'::text COLLATE "POSIX")
