-               SubPlan exists_4
-                 ->  Seq Scan on int4_tbl tinner_2
-         ->  Index Only Scan using asptab1_pkey on asptab1 asptab_2
-               Index Cond: (id > (EXISTS(SubPlan exists_3))::integer)
-         SubPlan exists_3
-           ->  Seq Scan on int4_tbl tinner_1
-                 Filter: (f1 = touter.f1)
-   SubPlan exists_2
-     ->  Seq Scan on int4_tbl tinner
-(14 rows)
