-   Subplans Removed: 6
-   ->  Seq Scan on ab_a2_b1 ab_1 (actual rows=0.00 loops=1)
-         Filter: ((a >= $1) AND (a <= $2) AND (b <= $3))
-   ->  Seq Scan on ab_a2_b2 ab_2 (actual rows=0.00 loops=1)
-         Filter: ((a >= $1) AND (a <= $2) AND (b <= $3))
-   ->  Seq Scan on ab_a2_b3 ab_3 (actual rows=0.00 loops=1)
-         Filter: ((a >= $1) AND (a <= $2) AND (b <= $3))
-(8 rows)
-
