- Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default 
---------+---------+-----------+----------+---------
- a      | integer |           | not null | 
- b      | integer |           | not null | 
- c      | text    |           |          | 
-Partition key: RANGE (a, b)
-Indexes:
-    "idxpart_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (a, b)
-Number of partitions: 0
-
