--- /home/ivan_kanga/univer/diplom/postgres/src/test/regress/expected/memoize.out	2026-04-14 01:28:04.257202366 +0300
+++ /home/ivan_kanga/univer/diplom/postgres/src/test/regress/results/memoize.out	2026-05-01 17:33:32.542493594 +0300
